	"name": "Lone Wanderer",
	"type": "culture",
	"img": "icons/environment/wilderness/terrain-river-road-gray.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Characters raised as lone wanderers share a variety of traits in common with one another.&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Culture of My Own.&nbsp;</em></strong>You have rejected other cultures in favor of building your own. You gain four skill or tool proficiencies of your choice.&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Heirloom.</em></strong>&nbsp;You carry a family or cultural heirloom. Choose one weapon worth 100 gold&nbsp;or less. You begin&nbsp;play with a&nbsp;masterwork&nbsp;version of that weapon.</p><p><strong><em>Languages</em></strong>. You can speak, read, write, and sign Common and two additional languages.</p>",
